[NDBG.20.1] Returns the working-memory delta between two positions,
each a timeline and an instant in it ([NDBG.14.17]): two instants of one
timeline, or a fork against the real run.

Request:
```json
{
  "from": { "timeline": "%0", "at_ns": 45000000000 },
  "to":   { "timeline": "%1", "at_ns": 46000000000 }
}
```

Response:
```json
{
  "asserted": [
    { "schema": "Alert",
      "fact_id": "#99",
      "slots": { "entity_id": "kitchen_temp", "level": "high" } }
  ],
  "retracted": [
    { "schema": "Sensor",
      "fact_id": "#42",
      "slots": { "entity_id": "bedroom", "value": 71.0 } }
  ]
}
```
